baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 영토 건물 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/map/territories/1/buildings

### 영토 건물 배치
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/map/territories/1/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buildingTypeId": 1,
  "posX": 3,
  "posY": 3
}

### 건물 업그레이드
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/buildings/1/upgrade
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 건물 수리
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/buildings/1/repair
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 건물 보관 (보관함으로 이동)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/buildings/1/store
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 건물 이동
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/buildings/1/move
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "posX": 4,
  "posY": 2
}

### 섬 정보 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/island
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 섬 건물 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/island/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 섬 건물 배치
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/island/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buildingTypeId": 3,
  "posX": 0,
  "posY": 0
}

### 보관함 건물 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 보관함 건물 영토에 배치
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/1/place
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "territoryId": 1,
  "posX": 2,
  "posY": 3
}
